## Journals

Each journal index below lists current and back volumes, individual issues, and articles published ahead of print.

- [Journals Hub](https://www.psychologicalscience.org/publications): Index of all six APS journals and the Observer.
- [Psychological Science](https://www.psychologicalscience.org/journals/psychological-science): Flagship peer-reviewed journal publishing empirical research across the science of psychology. 5,645 archived articles.
- [Current Directions in Psychological Science](https://www.psychologicalscience.org/journals/current-directions): Concise, accessible reviews of cutting-edge research. 2,227 archived articles.
- [Perspectives on Psychological Science](https://www.psychologicalscience.org/journals/perspectives): Broad, integrative articles spanning psychology and related fields. 1,516 archived articles.
- [Clinical Psychological Science](https://www.psychologicalscience.org/journals/clinical): Peer-reviewed journal advancing clinical psychological science. 1,091 archived articles.
- [Advances in Methods and Practices in Psychological Science (AMPPS)](https://www.psychologicalscience.org/journals/ampps): Methods, tutorials, and best-practice articles. 370 archived articles.
- [Psychological Science in the Public Interest](https://www.psychologicalscience.org/publications/pspi): Authoritative monographs reviewing topics of public concern. 218 archived articles.

Each journal also has an editorial landing page under `/publications/` carrying its aims and scope, editorial team, and submission information: `/publications/psychological_science`, `/publications/current_directions`, `/publications/perspectives`, `/publications/clinical`, `/publications/ampps`, `/publications/pspi`.

## Journal Article Archive

Every article APS has published across its six journals has a durable page on this site carrying its title, authors with ORCID identifiers and affiliations, abstract, DOI, volume, issue, pagination, and funder information, marked up as schema.org ScholarlyArticle. Records are sourced from Crossref and cover 11,067 articles. All pages are listed in the sitemap at https://www.psychologicalscience.org/wp-sitemap.xml

URL patterns, where `<journal>` is one of `psychological-science`, `current-directions`, `perspectives`, `clinical`, `ampps`, `pspi`:

- `/journals/<journal>` — journal index: all volumes and issues
- `/journals/<journal>/volume/<number>` — one volume, listing its issues
- `/journals/<journal>/volume/<number>/issue/<number>` — one issue's table of contents
- `/journals/<journal>/online-first` — articles published ahead of print
- `/journals/<journal>/<doi-suffix>` — a single article, e.g. https://www.psychologicalscience.org/journals/psychological-science/09567976251401538

Exception: `/journals/pspi` redirects to https://www.psychologicalscience.org/publications/pspi, which serves as that journal's index. Its `/online-first` and article routes work as above.

Editorial boards and submission guidelines live under each journal's publications path, for example [Psychological Science Editorial Team](https://www.psychologicalscience.org/publications/psychological_science/editorial-board) and [Current Directions Submission Guidelines](https://www.psychologicalscience.org/publications/current_directions/cd-submissions).

