## Convention Archive

A searchable archive of the scientific programs of 14 APS conventions: 3,584 sessions, 26,939 talks and posters, 26,990 abstracts, and 55,253 presenter records, browsable by session, by presentation, and by presenter. Coverage begins with the 2017 Annual Convention; earlier meetings back to 1989 are listed by name and location only.

URL patterns, where `<code>` is a meeting code from the list below:

- `/conventions/archive` — index of all archived meetings, grouped by year
- `/conventions/archive/<code>` — one meeting, with faceted search across its sessions, speakers, and posters
- `/conventions/archive/<code>/session/<id>` — one session and the presentations within it
- `/conventions/archive/<code>/paper/<id>` — one talk or poster, with its abstract
- `/conventions/archive/<code>/person/<id>` — one presenter, with their sessions and presentations

